# Pairs with PublicationWindowTracked. A writer that crashes owing a re-publish
# must leave the write tracked until membership declares it dead; the mutant
# forgets it, so nothing covers the returned write.
MODULE: SiloCrashForgetsWrite
TARGET: PublicationWindowTracked
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a writer crash drops the write it returned ahead of coverage
PERTURBS: SiloCrash
BOUNDS: NumSilos = 1, MaxCrashes = 1, MaxFailures = 1

--- FIND
    /\ wstate' = IF wsilo = s /\ Writing THEN "crashed" ELSE wstate
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the write is forgotten.
    /\ wstate' = IF wsilo = s /\ Writing THEN "idle" ELSE wstate
--- END
